    "body": "This worker stopped before claiming and added `blocked` because #2696 depends on #2693.\n\nChecked `upstream/main` at `e048b103ca649e24048268e1a050f0b4686a997a`:\n- `WireRuled` in `crates/motion/src/wire_edm/ruled.rs` has no `heal_tolerance` field.\n- `laws::cover` and `laws::cover_run` in `crates/motion/src/wire_edm/laws.rs` use `COVER_TOL` and do not emit uncut-corner notes to `Toolpath::notes`.\n- `git grep -n heal_tolerance upstream/main` returns no matches.\n\nPrerequisite status:\n- Issue #2693 adds `WireRuled.heal_tolerance`, relaxes `laws::cover`, and defines the uncut-corner note in `Toolpath::notes`.\n- Issue #2693 is open with the `claimed` label (`2026-11-19T19:39:05Z`), and has no open PR or branch on `origin` to stack on.\n\nOpen-PR checks on expected files for #2696:\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/edit.rs`: open PR #2773.\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs`: open PRs #2714, #2678, #2554, and #2149.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/types/wire_edm.rs`, `crates/app/src/project/wire_edm_dto.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/wire_ruled.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/wire_page.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/approach_page.rs`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/op_page.rs`: no open PRs.\n\nThis worker created no claim, branch, worktree, code change, or test run.\nRemove `blocked` and resume #2696 after #2693 opens a PR to stack on or merges into `main`.\n",
